{"candidateAnswer":"Two years before 1 August 2023 (i.e., August 2021)","evidence":"[D16:6 | 9:26 am on 1 August, 2023] Jolene: I adopted her two years ago when I was feeling lonely and wanted some company.\n[D28:26 | 3:09 pm on 15 September, 2023] Jolene: It`s Susie! I've had her for two years now. ","itemId":"urn:uuid:eb96b924-f88a-5c9d-aea8-3ec136d07bf6","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:2ec6140d7a49f994b4f2fa4f7fb977767445c02368d0bd09719633561613992c","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"When did Jolene adopt her snake Susie?","referenceAnswer":"in 2021","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"2ec6140d7a49f994b4f2fa4f7fb977767445c02368d0bd09719633561613992c"}}]}